Package: xmcs
Version: 1.9-0+csharp
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: mono-runtime (>= 6.0) | dotnet-runtime-8.0, dpkg, wget, tar, gzip
Recommends: mono-mcs | dotnet-sdk-8.0
Maintainer: Zizhao <zizhao@localhost>
Description: XPM C# Backend (Special Edition)
 xmcs is the C# implementation of the XPM backend.
 It handles package unpacking, installation, removal, and verification
 using only dpkg, tar, and wget (never apt).
 .
 This is a special edition demonstrating that the XPM architecture
 is language-agnostic - same locks, same .oil format, same database.
 .
 Oil: 100001% | Power: 1.x W | Systemd: not required
